.*         DADSM FUNCTIONS:                                             01150002
.*                                                                      01200002
.*             SCRATCH                                                  01250002
.*                                                                      01300002
.*         TO REFERENCE THIS WORK AREA WITHIN THE FUNCTIONS LISTED      01350002
.*         ABOVE, CODE A USING STATEMENT ON THE LABEL 'SCRTHWKA'.       01400002
.*                                                                      01450002
.*      DEPENDENCIES = THIS MACRO IS DESIGNED TO BE USED OPTIONALLY     01500002
.*                     WITH THE IECSDSL1 DSCB MAPPING MACRO, THE        01550002
.*                     PREFX MACRO (DEFINED IN THE IECDSECS MACRO)      01600002
.*                     WHICH DEFINES THE 8 WORD WORK AREA PREFIX,       01650002
.*                     THE 20 WORD EXTENDED WORK AREA PREFIX, AND       01700002
.*                     THE 4 WORD DADSM WTG TABLE, AND THE DSMADT       01750002
.*                     MACRO (ALSO DEFINED IN THE IECDSECS MACRO)       01800002
.*                     WHICH DEFINES THE 6 WORD DADSM AUDIT TRAIL.      01850002
.*                     THE AUDIT TRAIL MUST APPEAR AS THE      @ZA31933 01856008
.*                     FINAL 6 WORDS OF THE SCRATCH WORK AREA. @ZA31933 01862008
.*                                                                      01870008
.*                     THE FIRST 364 BYTES OF THE SCRATCH AND RENAME    01900002
.*                     WORK AREAS (ADDRESSED RESPECTIVELY BY MAPPING    01950002
.*                     MACROS IECSCRWA AND IECRENWA) ARE MAPPED         02000002
.*                     IDENTICALLY - 8 WORD PREFIX, 20 WORD EXTENDED    02050002
.*                     PREFIX, 4 WORD DADSM WTG TABLE, 96 BYTE DSCB     02100002
.*                     AREA, AND 140 BYTE DSCB AREA.  THE 250  @ZA31933 02150008
.*                     BYTES FROM LABELS 'WKADEB' THROUGH      @ZA31933 02160008
.*                     'PVOLSER' ARE ALSO MAPPED IDENTICALLY.  @ZA31933 02170008
.*                                                                      02180008
