.*                                                                      03100002
.*      PURPOSE = THIS MACRO IS CALLED AT ASSEMBLY TIME BY THE          03150002
.*                FUNCTIONS LISTED UNDER 'NOTES' TO EXPAND THE          03200002
.*                SCRATCH WORK AREA.                                    03250002
.*                                                                      03300002
